			"Message": "docs(Rest): Fix Rust API documentation URL casing\n\nCorrect the Rust API documentation reference in README.md from the mixed-case legacy domain Rust.Documentation.Land.PlayForm.Cloud to the lowercase canonical endpoint rust.documentation.land.playform.cloud.\n\nThe packaged bin/Rest binary is also updated in this revision.",
